# Route: guide 17 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to 39, 29
# quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands, Loch Modan, The Barrens): Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs ->
# Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> The
# Maker's Terrace -> Agmond's End -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl
# -> Hammertoe's Digsite -> Valley of Fangs -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Black Box (708; Zaricotl
# 55-56); Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan Deepshadow 38).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1559 Flash Bomb
# Recipe.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

